  "worked_solution": "From the diagram, $∠COF$ is a straight angle. So, the angle addition postulate gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠COD+m∠DOE+m∠EOF & =m∠COF \\\\ {75}^{∘}+m∠DOE+{75}^{∘} & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ m∠DOE & ={30}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe also note that $∠AOB$ and $∠DOE$ are vertical angles. Therefore, since vertical angles are congruent, we have\n\n$$\nm∠AOB=m∠DOE={30}^{∘}.\n$$",
